208
00:18:09,470 --> 00:18:11,110
We'll see how I feel about it, but...

209
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:12,970
It's something I've been thinking about for a while.

210
00:18:14,430 --> 00:18:16,310
More games, more streams.

211
00:18:18,570 --> 00:18:22,450
And maybe just have one game on local recording going at any one time?

212
00:18:24,390 --> 00:18:26,470
I'm not sure yet, I haven't decided, but...

213
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:28,550
I actually really enjoy streaming.

214
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:32,530
Although it is kind of weird, the way I stream, right?

215
00:18:32,650 --> 00:18:34,010
I'm not really interacting with chat.

216
00:18:36,210 --> 00:18:38,750
But I guess some of you guys are enjoying that part of it.

217
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:41,950
It's just very, very unusual, right, nowadays.

218
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:45,250
And it's not something that a lot of people are into, I think.

219
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:53,380
Well, you would say that, G-Game, because you're here right now, right?

220
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:57,400
You're kind of biased, just by your existence in this chat right now.

221
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:00,920
Please don't burn yourself out.

222
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:03,660
Trust me, I am thinking about that a lot.

223
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:05,140
I am not burning myself out.

224
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:08,060
I am taking breaks quite often, if you haven't noticed.

225
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:14,420
I haven't uploaded anything on YouTube the last five or six days, because I was, you know, celebrating a holiday.

226
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:17,580
And I also do take regular breaks.

227
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:31,320
The thing is, though, something I've realized after going full-time with streaming, and I guess just content creation, you could say, is that I am not producing good content if I'm not in the mood for making it.

228
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:36,080
You know, it's like saying, Boss, I can't come to work today, I don't feel like working.

229
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,100
So I'm not going to produce any good work.

230
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:44,400
It sounds stupid when you say it like that, but I am in a position where I can choose to do that, I guess, right?

231
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:49,960
Because I don't think I make good content when I don't want to play the game that I'm playing, right?

232
00:19:51,120 --> 00:19:55,140
So it's kind of limiting me a little bit in my output ability.

233
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:58,260
In my cadence of uploads.

234
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:02,800
I can't pump out uploads, like, two videos a day, every single day.

235
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:07,980
It will burn me out, I will not enjoy games as much anymore, and that will reduce quality of the content.

236
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:12,200
But it's kind of a thing that goes against...

237
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:14,420
Because I also gotta make money to survive, right?

238
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:17,840
So it's like a weird balance to strike right now.

239
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,100
I'm still trying to figure that out.

240
00:20:24,310 --> 00:20:27,510
