241
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:31,470
I will let you know if I vanish for months, okay?

242
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:32,350
I will give you notice.

243
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:38,620
I think the viewers could also get burned out.

244
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:41,180
Yeah, but it's different, because you can just choose not to watch it, right?

245
00:20:45,190 --> 00:20:49,030
But I guess it is, I don't want to spam people with notifications either, and...

246
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:50,610
It's kind of a weird situation.

247
00:20:58,480 --> 00:20:59,680
About to evaporate.

248
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:02,020
I mean...

249
00:21:02,020 --> 00:21:02,540
Yeah.

250
