If I were to do this in a way that would maximize my earnings on ads and all of that, just for earning money...

254
00:21:22,580 --> 00:21:25,640
All I would do is just stream Minecraft every day.

255
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:29,820
No local recordings, because compared to that, I earn nothing.

256
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:33,800
Like, Minecraft is by far the most lucrative thing I have ever done.

257
00:21:34,180 --> 00:21:35,920
But I don't want to play that every day.

258
00:21:36,480 --> 00:21:37,140
You know?

