03:16:31,200 --> 03:16:32,080
Okay.

3633
03:16:45,080 --> 03:16:47,260
Am I strong enough now with the...

3634
03:16:47,260 --> 03:16:48,400
gauntlets?

3635
03:16:53,500 --> 03:16:55,220
Okay, so Navi's pointing it out.

3636
03:16:57,640 --> 03:16:58,440
Question marks.

3637
03:16:59,380 --> 03:17:00,600
Yeah, what on earth is that?

3638
03:17:09,670 --> 03:17:12,290
I mean, I could, when in doubt, play songs, right?

3639
03:17:16,090 --> 03:17:18,770
It's the same symbol as on my shield, actually.

3640
03:17:20,490 --> 03:17:22,890
Uh, but I don't know which song would be appropriate here.

3641
03:17:29,340 --> 03:17:29,780
Sun...

3642
03:17:30,360 --> 03:17:30,800
Time...

3643
03:17:31,400 --> 03:17:32,280
Probably time.

3644
03:17:33,540 --> 03:17:34,700
There, there, there.

3645
03:17:34,980 --> 03:17:36,280
Okay, right A down.

3646
03:17:36,920 --> 03:17:37,440
Right A down.

3647
03:17:51,300 --> 03:17:52,600
I'm not sure about that one.

3648
03:17:54,980 --> 03:17:55,580
I ha...

3649
03:17:55,580 --> 03:17:57,220
Okay, here's what I think is gonna happen.

3650
03:17:57,320 --> 03:17:58,320
At some point, this will open.

3651
03:17:58,880 --> 03:18:00,680
And this is how I will get a...

3652
03:18:00,680 --> 03:18:02,660
like a back entrance into the castle up there.

3653
03:18:03,480 --> 03:18:05,460
And that is how I will infiltrate it.

3654
03:18:08,300 --> 03:18:09,020
In some...

3655
03:18:09,020 --> 03:18:12,780
Okay, then again, the thing is floating in the air, so I'm not sure how that's gonna work, but...

3656
03:18:14,500 --> 03:18:15,360
You know what I mean.

3657
03:18:16,440 --> 03:18:19,000
By magical powers of game design.

3658
03:18:19,860 --> 03:18:20,540
It'll happen.

3659
03:18:24,540 --> 03:18:25,920
Okay, so it's not here, it seems.

3660
03:18:28,540 --> 03:18:32,300
Uh, I mean, we could just try and go around to the different spots that we know of.

3661
03:18:34,800 --> 03:18:35,700
Get away from me.

3662
03:18:36,640 --> 03:18:37,420
Disgusting people.

3663
03:18:41,970 --> 03:18:42,690
Let me go in here.

3664
03:18:46,330 --> 03:18:47,610
Do you have any advice for me?

3665
03:18:49,630 --> 03:18:50,570
Uh, your card...

3666
03:18:50,570 --> 03:18:52,650
Yeah, I'm maxed out on my card, I'm sorry.

3667
03:18:54,590 --> 03:18:57,770
But in the good way, my card is maxed out, I can't have any more money on it.

3668
03:18:58,270 --> 03:18:59,210
I've got 500.

3669
03:19:03,090 --> 03:19:05,750
All right, Epona, let's head to...

3670
03:19:06,250 --> 03:19:07,480
Uh, let's go to...

3671
03:19:08,050 --> 03:19:09,390
Let me see, what's next on the map?

3672
03:19:12,840 --> 03:19:15,740
Uh, we could go to Kakariko, I guess.

3673
03:19:16,060 --> 03:19:19,760
Or we go back to the Kokiri Forest, back to where we started.

3674
03:19:25,560 --> 03:19:26,280
Let's do both.

3675
03:19:32,380 --> 03:19:35,240
First we go here, and then maybe also Death Mountain, actually, since we're close.

3676
03:19:35,240 --> 03:19:38,000
Especially because that has a shortcut.

3677
03:19:38,760 --> 03:19:39,640
To go...

3678
03:19:39,640 --> 03:19:40,460
Epona, what are you doing?

3679
03:19:41,360 --> 03:19:42,560
Okay, you don't want to go up there?

3680
03:19:44,960 --> 03:19:46,260
Ah, all right.

3681
03:19:46,900 --> 03:19:48,580
Don't cause any trouble now, you hear me?

3682
03:19:56,300 --> 03:19:56,860
Oh!

3683
03:20:03,210 --> 03:20:03,770
No!

3684
03:20:06,010 --> 03:20:07,570
The windmill is on fire!

3685
03:20:12,000 --> 03:20:13,640
The whole town is on fire.

3686
03:20:25,250 --> 03:20:26,590
Get back, Link!

3687
03:20:27,430 --> 03:20:28,070
What?

3688
03:20:28,510 --> 03:20:28,810
Why?

3689
03:20:31,290 --> 03:20:32,610
What is happening?

3690
03:20:35,490 --> 03:20:37,670
Oh no, are they causing trouble down there again?

3691
03:20:42,250 --> 03:20:42,890
Oh!

3692
03:20:45,050 --> 03:20:45,690
Oh!

3693
03:20:48,010 --> 03:20:48,890
Oh, dang!

3694
03:20:54,230 --> 03:20:55,770
Oh, the evil spirit.

3695
03:21:05,270 --> 03:21:06,270
Where's it going?

3696
03:21:14,780 --> 03:21:15,960
You got this, Link.

3697
03:21:24,940 --> 03:21:26,240
He didn't... got it.

3698
03:21:28,420 --> 03:21:29,920
Looks like you're coming around.

3699
03:21:32,400 --> 03:21:34,180
Oh, thank god for the rain now.

3700
03:21:34,720 --> 03:21:35,020
Link!

3701
03:21:35,220 --> 03:21:36,620
A terrible thing has happened.

3702
03:21:36,940 --> 03:21:39,120
The evil shadow spirit has been released.

3703
03:21:39,900 --> 03:21:41,060
Yeah, I saw it.

3704
03:21:42,400 --> 03:21:48,200
Impa, the leader of Kakariko Village, had sealed the evil shadow spirit in the bottom of the well.

3705
03:21:49,800 --> 03:21:56,480
But the force of the evil spirit got so strong, the seal of the well broke, and it escaped into the world.

3706
03:21:58,520 --> 03:21:59,080
Oh...

3707
03:22:00,620 --> 03:22:03,820
I believe Impa has gone to the shadow temple to seal it again.

3708
03:22:04,420 --> 03:22:07,300
But, she will be in danger without any help.

3709
03:22:09,080 --> 03:22:09,640
Link!

3710
03:22:09,640 --> 03:22:11,480
Impa is one of the six sages!

3711
03:22:11,960 --> 03:22:14,560
Destroy the evil shadow spirit and save Impa.

3712
03:22:16,140 --> 03:22:20,380
There is an entrance to the shadow temple beneath the graveyard behind this village.

3713
03:22:22,180 --> 03:22:23,100
No shit!

3714
03:22:24,640 --> 03:22:28,660
The only thing I can do for you is teach you the melody that will lead you to the shadow temple.

3715
03:22:29,540 --> 03:22:30,960
Oh, is it an evil melody?

3716
03:22:31,180 --> 03:22:33,060
I am so excited for this melody.

3717
03:22:34,800 --> 03:22:38,840
This is the melody that will draw you into the infinite darkness that absorbs even time.

3718
03:22:39,580 --> 03:22:40,560
Listen to this.

3719
03:22:41,100 --> 03:22:42,500
The Nocturne of Shadow.

3720
03:22:43,040 --> 03:22:44,960
Oh shit, we're installing Nos!

3721
03:22:54,040 --> 03:22:55,000
That's not evil.

3722
03:23:00,990 --> 03:23:01,510
Okay.

3723
03:23:06,600 --> 03:23:07,860
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

3724
03:23:07,960 --> 03:23:08,900
It was too good.

3725
03:23:09,140 --> 03:23:10,220
I needed to be more evil.

3726
03:23:10,560 --> 03:23:11,180
Forgive me.

3727
03:23:21,540 --> 03:23:22,900
Okay, yeah, that's kinda evil.

3728
03:23:24,300 --> 03:23:25,640
Or more like sad.

3729
03:23:28,840 --> 03:23:31,560
Wait, where did that instrument appear from?

3730
03:23:39,260 --> 03:23:41,220
You have learned the Nocturne of Shadow.

3731
03:23:43,180 --> 03:23:43,940
Hell yeah.

3732
03:23:45,500 --> 03:23:46,720
Let me take care of the village.

3733
03:23:46,960 --> 03:23:48,280
I'm counting on you, Link!

3734
03:23:48,920 --> 03:23:49,900
Okay, calm down.

3735
03:23:51,560 --> 03:23:54,220
I-I-I-I've delivered so far, haven't- Don't do it!

3736
03:23:54,680 --> 03:23:59,380
You- Motherf- Every time.

3737
03:24:00,960 --> 03:24:04,860
One of these days, I'm gonna... I'm gonna catch them in the act and...

3738
03:24:05,680 --> 03:24:07,180
So wait, uh...

3739
03:24:07,180 --> 03:24:09,540
You said the, um, graveyard, right?

3740
03:24:10,560 --> 03:24:12,460
I guess I could also just try and play the melody.

3741
03:24:13,860 --> 03:24:15,400
Look at the evil color too!

3742
03:24:16,380 --> 03:24:17,340
Nocturne of Shadow.

3743
03:24:18,140 --> 03:24:19,280
We could play it now.

3744
03:24:22,100 --> 03:24:23,300
Could I play it now?

3745
03:24:26,140 --> 03:24:28,400
Or do I go check on the people here first?

3746
03:24:29,280 --> 03:24:30,360
Shit was on fire, right?

3747
03:24:30,680 --> 03:24:31,160
So...

3748
03:24:31,160 --> 03:24:33,180
Is everyone alright, or...?

3749
03:24:34,240 --> 03:24:35,520
Oh, it looks like people are okay.

3750
03:24:38,020 --> 03:24:39,560
The lady here is really generous.

3751
03:24:39,820 --> 03:24:41,140
She even took care of the carpenters.

3752
03:24:41,620 --> 03:24:42,840
Yeah, but what about the fire though?

3753
03:24:45,220 --> 03:24:48,420
Look at the bearded man sleep- Yeah, okay, I know, you said that before.

3754
03:24:50,200 --> 03:24:53,060
Okay, you got nothing else to say- You didn't see the evil spirit?!

3755
03:24:54,580 --> 03:24:56,080
You guys are oblivious!

3756
03:25:01,080 --> 03:25:03,500
Wha- Oh yeah, you, weirdo.

3757
03:25:04,080 --> 03:25:05,100
In the rain too.

3758
03:25:05,780 --> 03:25:07,540
Please, with C's, sell me something.

3759
03:25:08,280 --> 03:25:09,540
I'm full on money, sorry.

3760
03:25:09,640 --> 03:25:10,400
No can do.

3761
03:25:11,520 --> 03:25:12,660
I'll be back later.

3762
03:25:16,040 --> 03:25:17,740
Yeah, only during the day.

3763
03:25:18,980 --> 03:25:20,240
Alright, I guess we're gonna play the melody.

3764
03:25:20,760 --> 03:25:21,700
NEXT TIME!

3765
03:25:22,120 --> 03:25:23,600
Perfect time to cliffhanger.

3766
03:25:24,160 --> 03:25:24,340
Boom.

3767
03:25:25,140 --> 03:25:26,040
What do you say to that?

3768
03:25:27,140 --> 03:25:28,460
You like that cliffhanger?

3769
03:25:30,660 --> 03:25:31,540
Shadow temple.

3770
03:25:32,200 --> 03:25:33,980
The evilest of all the places.

3771
03:25:34,980 --> 03:25:36,080
Actually, probably not.

3772
03:25:36,080 --> 03:25:43,280
I would bet that the Ganondorf- Dorf is the- By the way, Dorf is like village in German.

3773
03:25:43,760 --> 03:25:45,180
So that joke works, okay?

3774
03:25:45,960 --> 03:25:47,000
Get off my back.

3775
03:25:51,800 --> 03:25:52,860
What's going on, people?

3776
03:25:59,780 --> 03:26:00,800
Ganondorf, exactly.

3777
03:26:01,320 --> 03:26:02,400
He's kind of a dork.

3778
03:26:05,570 --> 03:26:08,130
He's doing all the evil person trope, you know?

3779
03:26:08,490 --> 03:26:08,890
Tropes.

3780
03:26:09,170 --> 03:26:09,590
That there is.

3781
03:26:14,100 --> 03:26:16,160
We didn't think you'd find the temple, to be honest.

3782
03:26:16,280 --> 03:26:16,640
Which one?

3783
03:26:20,980 --> 03:26:22,140
What temple did I find?

3784
03:26:23,960 --> 03:26:25,160
You mean the last one here?

3785
03:26:25,720 --> 03:26:26,900
Because I haven't found it yet.

3786
03:26:27,760 --> 03:26:29,920
Well, I assume I gotta play the melody and then I'm there.

3787
03:26:31,440 --> 03:26:32,560
Standard setup for evil.

3788
03:26:32,860 --> 03:26:33,180
Nice.

3789
03:26:38,560 --> 03:26:39,400
The current one.

3790
03:26:39,540 --> 03:26:39,920
Oh, okay.

3791
03:26:40,620 --> 03:26:44,180
I mean, honestly, I'm confused because there was no indication to go here.

3792
03:26:46,080 --> 03:26:48,420
I was ready to go to every single place on the map.

3793
03:26:48,820 --> 03:26:50,380
So I guess I just got lucky here.

3794
03:26:59,690 --> 03:27:03,590
Anyone else think of ska music every time Link shouts skank when he rolls?

3795
03:27:03,770 --> 03:27:04,410
Wait, what?

3796
03:27:05,270 --> 03:27:06,610
Does he shout skank?

3797
03:27:06,770 --> 03:27:07,550
I haven't noticed.

3798
03:27:09,390 --> 03:27:12,230
In fact, I can't actually remember what noises he makes.

3799
03:27:13,370 --> 03:27:15,830
It doesn't sit in my brain, the same as Super Mario.

3800
03:27:16,130 --> 03:27:17,450
But I guess those are iconic.

3801
03:27:20,370 --> 03:27:22,410
Skank is the dance for ska, okay.

3802
03:27:25,730 --> 03:27:27,770
We figured it would be one in a million shot.

3803
03:27:28,450 --> 03:27:28,830
Really?

3804
03:27:29,670 --> 03:27:31,070
Don't you mean one in seven?

3805
03:27:31,290 --> 03:27:32,790
Because there's like seven places to go.

3806
03:27:35,030 --> 03:27:36,170
Shark is... I don't know.

3807
03:27:36,450 --> 03:27:37,190
Oh, shark!

3808
03:27:38,690 --> 03:27:39,230
Shark!

3809
03:27:39,710 --> 03:27:41,490
That sounds like something from...

3810
03:27:42,310 --> 03:27:43,150
Hollow Knight.

3811
03:27:45,570 --> 03:27:46,110
Ambrera!

3812
03:27:46,870 --> 03:27:47,410
Skadi!

3813
03:27:49,730 --> 03:27:50,770
Something like that.

3814
03:27:51,410 --> 03:27:52,530
Yeah, sure, exactly.

3815
03:27:53,230 --> 03:27:53,770
Yep.

3816
03:27:54,650 --> 03:27:54,970
That's it.

3817
03:27:56,530 --> 03:27:59,270
I wonder if there's some of those shouts in Silksong.

3818
03:27:59,370 --> 03:28:02,770
Because I know the main protagonist of that game is that character.

3819
03:28:06,770 --> 03:28:08,250
You had to do it at night as an adult?

3820
03:28:08,650 --> 03:28:09,370
Holy shit!

3821
03:28:09,650 --> 03:28:11,030
Well, in that case...

3822
03:28:12,690 --> 03:28:13,730
Yeah, that was lucky then.

3823
03:28:14,370 --> 03:28:14,990
What the hell?

3824
03:28:19,280 --> 03:28:20,260
Sometimes you get lucky.

3825
03:28:26,200 --> 03:28:27,340
I don't know what that means.

3826
03:28:27,580 --> 03:28:28,160
Any au do?

3827
03:28:28,900 --> 03:28:29,920
Any au dax?

3828
03:28:30,520 --> 03:28:31,520
Any o dax?

3829
03:28:33,660 --> 03:28:35,860
I'm not sure if I should say o or au.

3830
03:28:39,090 --> 03:28:40,030
Don't worry about it.

3831
03:28:40,410 --> 03:28:41,450
Okay, I won't worry about it.

3832
03:28:42,110 --> 03:28:42,450
Guys!

3833
03:28:42,930 --> 03:28:44,030
Today is Saturday.

3834
03:28:44,690 --> 03:28:45,070
Did you know?

3835
03:28:45,070 --> 03:28:46,770
What are you doing for lunch?

3836
03:28:47,430 --> 03:28:47,470
What are you doing for lunch?

3837
03:28:47,470 --> 03:28:48,250
Or dinner?

3838
03:28:48,650 --> 03:28:49,790
Or whatever time it is.

3839
03:28:51,610 --> 03:28:53,170
I'm obsessed with food lately.

3840
03:28:56,230 --> 03:28:57,520
I wanna copy your food.

3841
03:29:01,200 --> 03:29:02,060
Pizza day.

3842
03:29:02,880 --> 03:29:03,420
Huh.

3843
03:29:04,220 --> 03:29:04,840
Pizza.

3844
03:29:04,840 --> 03:29:04,920
Pizza.

3845
03:29:05,820 --> 03:29:08,440
You know, I haven't made a pizza homemade in a while.

3846
03:29:09,000 --> 03:29:09,860
Maybe you should do that.

3847
03:29:11,300 --> 03:29:14,520
I had like a period in my life where I made like a lot of homemade pizzas.

3848
03:29:15,680 --> 03:29:19,280
I would like, you know, spin the dough on my hand and all that.

3849
03:29:19,400 --> 03:29:21,680
Well, not very successfully, but I was doing it.

3850
03:29:22,200 --> 03:29:24,480
I had a whole thing going for a while and then I just stopped.

3851
03:29:25,100 --> 03:29:26,860
I don't think I can remember how I did it.

3852
03:29:30,200 --> 03:29:31,220
Ate a bowl of cereal?

3853
03:29:31,420 --> 03:29:33,600
Oh, okay, so it's morning for you or not.

3854
03:29:33,600 --> 03:29:34,080
I don't know.

3855
03:29:35,020 --> 03:29:36,360
I mean, cereal is tasty.

3856
03:29:39,500 --> 03:29:40,300
Chinese banquet!

3857
03:29:40,460 --> 03:29:41,160
Holy shit!

3858
03:29:41,260 --> 03:29:42,140
You know what, actually?

3859
03:29:42,860 --> 03:29:45,720
There is a Chinese place next to me that does too good to go.

3860
03:29:46,140 --> 03:29:47,520
Which is like a thing we have here.

3861
03:29:47,680 --> 03:29:48,940
Maybe also other places in the world.

3862
03:29:49,060 --> 03:29:50,380
But in Denmark at least, there's an app.

3863
03:29:50,900 --> 03:29:55,960
And you can sort of sign up for food that was gonna be thrown away anyway and you get it super cheap.

3864
03:29:57,120 --> 03:29:58,660
That is actually an idea.

3865
03:29:59,480 --> 03:30:00,400
You also have that?

3866
03:30:01,640 --> 03:30:02,520
It's so good.

3867
03:30:02,680 --> 03:30:03,300
I love that.

3868
03:30:04,580 --> 03:30:07,120
There's nothing worse than throwing away perfectly good food.

3869
03:30:10,520 --> 03:30:12,260
I had a whole pasta making face?

3870
03:30:12,900 --> 03:30:13,100
Wait.

3871
03:30:14,060 --> 03:30:16,620
Kitsch, did you also have pasta machines then?

3872
03:30:16,900 --> 03:30:19,640
That would cut like spaghetti or something like that?

3873
03:30:20,060 --> 03:30:21,500
Or did you do it all by hand?

3874
03:30:24,100 --> 03:30:25,620
Because I've always wanted to try that.

3875
03:30:26,640 --> 03:30:28,400
I haven't ever made my own pasta.

3876
03:30:36,340 --> 03:30:37,100
Penicidi elbows?

3877
03:30:37,400 --> 03:30:37,680
Wait, what?

3878
03:30:42,090 --> 03:30:48,170
The other day I, like before Christmas, I got a too good to go bag from the supermarket too.

3879
03:30:48,810 --> 03:30:50,850
And it didn't specify what was gonna be in it, right?

3880
03:30:51,010 --> 03:30:52,110
It was completely random.

3881
03:30:52,110 --> 03:30:54,390
And I got a huge bag.

3882
03:30:54,530 --> 03:30:55,890
And this was 19 kroners.

3883
03:30:56,310 --> 03:30:59,170
Which is, I think, two and a half dollars or something.

3884
03:30:59,670 --> 03:31:00,850
Very little money, right?

3885
03:31:01,130 --> 03:31:05,750
And I got a huge bag with like, I think 12 or 15 donuts.

3886
03:31:06,810 --> 03:31:07,810
Five focaccias.

3887
03:31:08,510 --> 03:31:09,950
And something else as well.

3888
03:31:10,050 --> 03:31:10,850
Like, it was insane.

3889
03:31:11,310 --> 03:31:14,850
I couldn't eat it all before it went bad, so I gave half of it to my neighbor.

3890
03:31:15,990 --> 03:31:17,890
And still, I had to throw out a couple pieces.

3891
03:31:18,790 --> 03:31:22,510
It was so much food, but I guess it's better than it going in the waste, right?

3892
03:31:24,790 --> 03:31:25,850
You love focaccia?

3893
03:31:25,950 --> 03:31:26,410
Yeah, it's good.

3894
